{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06524","headline":"游茅山五首 四 · 储光羲","name":"游茅山五首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔贤居柱下，今我去人间。\n良以直心旷，兼之外视闲。\n垂纶非钓国，好学异希颜。\n落日登高屿，悠然望远山。\n溪流碧水去，云带清阴还。\n想见中林士，岩扉长不关。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06524.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06524","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}